    "scope": "Thirty-five diff.13 messages explicitly name sky130rf_nlowvt devices. The published F2a nlowvt family requires drawn lvtn; the GDS table identifies 125:44 as the low-Vt NMOS device purpose. Empty lvtn, all published CLVTNM mask/edit purposes, low-Vt identifier, and no low-Vt/RF cell or text hints establish this family absent. This is not a numerical RF geometry pass, recognition of present RF devices, or a substitute for the missing fixed-layout model map and Table H5. Three messages explicitly target bondpad existence or opening: C3 defines bondPad as pad:dg OUTSIDE areaid:ft. All pad drawing, mask, pin, label, center and frame guards and intent hints must be empty. Present or ambiguous subjects remain unreviewed, even when enclosure layers are missing. Other RF families and pad variants are not covered.",
